### Variables
@taskId = 1

### 1. Create a new Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar Backend",
  "description": "Mempelajari dasar-dasar API dengan NestJS"
}

### 2. Get All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update Task by ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar NestJS Lanjutan",
  "status": "ON_PROGRESS"
}

### 5. Delete Task by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
